 0 months\\nCategory: Music & Dance\\n\\nMove\, groove\, and connect during
  our Grown Up &amp\; Me Dance Workshop with Platinum Performing Arts. This
  interactive class invites children and their grown-ups to dance together\
 , explore movement\, and share special moments through music and play.  D
 esigned for all experience levels\, this workshop focuses on connection\, 
 confidence\, and creativity\, making it a fun and meaningful way to bond.
  \n\n\n\n11am and 2:30pm: &#8220\;Grown Up &amp\; Me” Dance Workshop 
 \n&nbsp\;\n\nSpace is limited! Book your tickets in advance to avoid del
 ays!\n\n\nAbout Play Partner  Platinum Performing Arts is a non-profit d
 ance &amp\; theatre studio located in Orange. Our mission focuses on mak
 ing high quality performing arts classes and experiences welcoming and acc
 essible to all. Through our inclusion program\, All Abilities classes\, an
 d scholarship options we hope to help every child shine onstage! \n\n\n*M
 embers do not require a reservation. *Events and dates are subject to chan
 ge.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.pretendcity.org/events/platinum-performing
 -arts/
